  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>史詩光影 - 所有光影包</strong></h1><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>介紹</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>準備好徹底改變你的Minecraft體驗吧！</strong><strong>有了光影，你現在可以享受Minecraft應有的遊戲體驗。此包包含目前所有可用的光影！如果你是光影開發者，希望你的光影加入此包，請與我們聯繫！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>（以下功能將進一步提升你的原版體驗）</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🔶 所有光影 - 享受超過150種光影的龐大收藏！只需進入Iris光影選單，選擇你最喜歡的光影包即可。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🔶 效能 - 藉由Sodium及其他效能優化模組。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🔶 動畫 - 獨特的生物動畫</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🔶 FPS顯示 - 在螢幕左上角顯示你的FPS</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🔶 字型 - 此包附帶額外的字型與資源</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🔶 Hypixel就緒 - 預載Hypixel伺服器，安裝即可遊玩！（可透過多人遊戲選單進入）</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>截圖</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/770/320/2023-12-06_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"447\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/770/321/2023-12-06_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"447\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/770/322/2023-12-06_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"447\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/770/323/2023-12-06_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"447\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/770/326/2023-12-06_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"447\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/770/327/2023-12-06_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"447\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/770/328/2023-12-06_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"447\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/770/329/2023-12-06_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"447\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即獲取伺服器並與朋友一起玩！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方橫幅，使用代碼<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>可享75折優惠！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
